# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dev-run scratch (the E-runs): the receipt dirs move with the layout rule (card t_f2636df1) and
# are committed under `docs/evidence/` — `docs/evidence/e2e/`, `docs/evidence/e3*/`,
# `docs/evidence/t*/` carry the receipts `docs/` cites, and the QA/spec notes live in `docs/qa/`.
# Their raw per-run logs, smoke/ad-hoc probe logs and mutmut tree copies are not repo content.
# Rules only ever affect *new* files: a receipt already tracked stays tracked
# (the `docs/evidence/e3b/logs` and `docs/evidence/e3c/logs` pins below say which files those are).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# mutmut working copies (the live workspace is `/mutants/` above)
mutants-*/
mutants.*/
mutants_*/
.mutmut-cache*
